"},{"type":"flow","items":["Video","Unified Athlete Dataset"]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Twins"},{"type":"p","text":"Potentially model an athlete's:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Movement"},{"text":"Loading"},{"text":"Performance"},{"text":"Training response"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI-Based Technique Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"AI can compare movement patterns and identify differences between:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Elite vs developing athletes"},{"text":"Efficient vs inefficient technique"},{"text":"Normal vs abnormal movement patterns"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Real-Time Biomechanics"},{"type":"p","text":"Future systems will increasingly provide feedback during training rather than only after laboratory analysis."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"p","text":"Human Anatomy"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Exercise Physiology"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Engineering Mechanics"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Biomechanics"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Kinematics & Kinetics"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Motion Capture"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Force Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Wearable Sensors / IMU"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Signal Processing"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Statistics"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Python / MATLAB"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Computer Vision"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Machine Learning"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Sports Performance Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Experimental Design"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Scientific Documentation"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Real Sports / Research Internship"},{"type":"h","text":"Target Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should ideally be